## Summary

The file is a small Express.js application with three endpoints and no obvious *exploitable* vulnerabilities (no SQL, no user input being processed, no auth logic to break). However, it is missing nearly every defense-in-depth measure you'd expect in a production app, and several OWASP Top 10 categories apply by *omission*. Below are findings organized by severity.

