## 🔴 High-Severity Findings

### 1. No Security HTTP Headers (OWASP A05: Security Misconfiguration)

Express by default sends `X-Powered-By: Express` (information disclosure) and sets none of the modern security headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, etc.).

**Recommendation:** Use [`helmet`](https://helmetjs.github.io/).

```js
