### 1. Sensitive data exposure in `/users` (OWASP A01: Broken Access Control, A02: Cryptographic Failures)

```js
app.get('/users', (req, res) => {
  res.json([
    { id: 1, name: 'Alice', email: 'alice@example.com' },
    { id: 2, name: 'Bob', email: 'bob@example.com' },
  ]);
