### 11. Hardcoded port / no TLS (OWASP A02)

`app.listen(3000, ...)` hardcodes the port and binds on all interfaces by default. In production, terminate TLS at a reverse proxy (nginx, ALB) or use `https.createServer`, and bind explicitly:

```js
